### Santé
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/health

### ========================================
### AUTH
### ========================================

### Connexion admin
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@dagno.ml",
  "password": "Admin@2026"
}

### Connexion client
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "client@dagno.ml",
  "password": "Client@2026"
}

### ========================================
### PUBLIC
### ========================================

### Marques
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/brands

### Téléphones
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/phones

### Accessoires
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/accessories

### Types de réparation
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/repairs/types

### ========================================
### ADMIN (remplace TOKEN_ADMIN par le token obtenu plus haut)
### ========================================

### Liste admin des téléphones
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/admin/phones
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_ADMIN

### Créer un téléphone
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/admin/phones
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_ADMIN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brandId": "REMPLACE_PAR_UN_ID_DE_MARQUE",
  "model": "iPhone 16 Pro",
  "storage": "256 Go",
  "color": "Titane noir",
  "condition": "NEW",
  "price": 1250000,
  "stock": 2,
  "description": "Nouveau modèle 2026, scellé.",
  "warrantyMonths": 12
}

### Liste admin des tickets de réparation
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/admin/repairs/tickets
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_ADMIN
### Upload d'une image (nécessite TOKEN_ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/admin/uploads
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_ADMIN
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< C:\Users\Admin\Desktop\test.jpg
------Boundary--